Package: pool-coordinator
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: supervisor, libsqlite3-0, ca-certificates
Suggests: caddy
Maintainer: Stephan M. February <https://github.com/twostack/pool-coordinator/issues>
Homepage: https://github.com/twostack/pool-coordinator
Description: TSL1_SP shielded pool coordinator for BSV
 Runs one TSL1_SP shielded pool: takes wallets' transfers over a ricochet
 inbox, proves and publishes the pool's rounds on BSV, funds them from its
 own wallet, and answers wallets catching up. Optionally serves a read-only
 API for the pool's public page, behind a proxy on the same host.
 .
 Installs as a supervisor program running as the pool-coordinator user.
 It is left stopped until a pool has been created.
